// Explicit globs (a config file without "globs" disables the default
// "**/*.md" set). Local-only directories must not gate Markdown linting:
// node_modules/ and .tools/ (the untracked bats-core install from
// scripts/install-bats.sh) are excluded via negated globs. Note: config
// globs reach globby raw, so negations use "!" (the CLI accepts "#").
{
  "globs": ["**/*.md", "!node_modules", "!.tools"],
}
